ng", "id": "1055531599147625", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974713_1055531602480958_3299547534509325263_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q6TJSCEg-PEQ7kNvwG6a9SX&_nc_oc=AdpWXkk6BN8aqMve6BDK7tm65coSL0vhy2aCtOyAHH5D9LPntIYr-d-rD-DqprfSSpM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG8Zb2XowvzvsL35zm0ds32rI_yoAUvhCLQ2q0n1eZm-Q&oe=6A8D8A1E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "683511393314653", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036684_683511396647986_3047485570719539906_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J5peoOECnrEQ7kNvwF9TETW&_nc_oc=Adp8tYHtIc8pXcMTT04SbRrlIOCeE-6mZ4mqWZQvxUtI1MoPVreM9Wr6_gboABeaTUk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEntUISAGKwCTjXWz2EqFoBpR-Izpf2ze8hIavLC0Be5Q&oe=6A8D6F81"}, {"file_name": "HORIZONTAL_COMP_3 (0-00-33-54).png", "id": "1458793048299052", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035383_1458793051632385_6201125288883864638_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tPKq37NTr8oQ7kNvwEaIMIQ&_nc_oc=Adqazn3Gph71zLO1G71ht49RYtIpcpyMIDH-CuyK8SJCWui9SdemWVY1yem4ui5HcE0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEBdEmfb8jA3LCk5jTheRJJ63TFOKf2s5vcNUs5AaYOyw&oe=6A8D847E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "827134765720718", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982592_827134769054051_8012892633401113797_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Di0pSAJL_qUQ7kNvwH6vnT6&_nc_oc=AdqN2JBVPW6aBG6Ck8-bzXkuTOurt5lhOappfIApIttF25JqoNr-Tz80hcqksw1Okn8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEbWZ2-_ux0w_OuKX8FUEEoR657B18DxdjRuO-UxZKA7A&oe=6A8D88A3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SaberCity_Trailer_Thumbnail_1.png", "id": "117461424774283", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75639796_117461428107616_4506053201965282111_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A2k2254HrtwQ7kNvwHBIPTk&_nc_oc=AdrekPtOGemxvQCMhcjq-kIGqLfuQTcUyjN_DWNtHLiPj4XPnifZ4CZufhdYuxP-OfU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGRmVZ14S2SwTePeqv68KF2heL6yZHh8Ji4wgH7RNudXg&oe=6A8D8EBB"}, "display_name": "Saber City", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Saber City is a 2-player co-located dueling game for Meta Quest. 2 players can link their headsets in the same physical space and battle with melee and ranged weapons. Saber City features mixed reality gameplay, so you and a friend can see each other in the real world ,via the Oculus Quest\u2019s cameras, and battle in AR.\n\n***NOTE:  Saber City is a multiplayer game and requires 2 Meta Quest headsets to play.\n\nIMPORTANT: Please maintain at least 3 feet distance between yourself and the other player. Be aware of your surroundings. Do not run with the headset on.\n\nYou can choose from 4 different character battle kits with unique weapons to wield in mixed reality. The current version of Saber City includes support for Meta Quest Pro and Quest 3.\n\nBattle Kits:\n\nCOWBORG - Cyber cowboy with cattle prod and shotgun\n\nSKYLORD - Hammer wielding warrior from beyond\n\nSKULL CZAR - Possessing dark energy sword and magic bow\n\nSABER SENTINAL - AR soldier with saber and pistol\n\nFor questions and feedback please join the Saber City Discord server: https://discord.gg/EhuQSbNeYV\n\nor contact via email: contact@yarwad.com\n\n", "short_description": "Saber City is a 2 player shared-space dueling game where players battle for supremacy in mixed-reality"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercityprivacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Yarwad Publishing Empire", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercity", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category"